WEBVTT

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:22.040
Burn! I summon you, Phoenix!

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:52.510
I am...

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:22.240
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:22.240
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:01:24.110 --> 00:01:29.740
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:01:24.110 --> 00:01:29.740
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:38.850
With our eyes on the future

00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:38.850
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:44.960
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:44.960
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:54.600
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:54.600
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:01:56.480 --> 00:02:02.110
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:01:56.480 --> 00:02:02.110
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:07.820
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:07.820
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:17.320
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:17.320
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:30.380
Welcome to the night of Wonderland.

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:35.480
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:41.250
Twelve years ago, the Pillar of
Darkness suddenly appeared

00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:45.920
and the two fighting beasts emerged.

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:48.990
Time went on,

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.960
and these two children
headed to Wonderland

00:02:52.070 --> 00:02:53.860
in search of their parents.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.970
This young lady they met
on the subway.

00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:02.970
This man crossed their path when
they reached their destination,

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:04.200
and on his arm is...

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.330
Excuse me...

00:03:36.140 --> 00:03:38.370
There's something shady about that guy.

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:45.180
Thank you!

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:48.710
You saved us, didn't you?!

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:51.920
Hey, Mister, you're looking for
someone too, aren't you?

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:55.190
You mentioned it earlier.
You asked if he was here.

00:03:57.700 --> 00:03:58.930
He's stopped.

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:01.470
It's because you're calling him Mister.

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:03.490
Even if it's a lie, maybe we should
start calling him Bro instead.

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:22.090
We're searching for someone too!

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:25.220
Rather than go off by yourself,
we should all just...

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:29.190
I have a favor to ask of you too!

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:32.070
If you happen to run into the parents

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:33.960
of these children somewhere in Wonderland,

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:36.090
tell them that they're looking for them!

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:39.370
Their names are Ai and Yu!

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:41.410
Their parents are named Hayakawa.

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:44.110
Please don't forget.

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:47.540
Kaze...

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:11.300
Crux...

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:15.600
Crux...

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:18.840
Go!

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:10.890
For example, using this shilkiss as a side dish...

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:16.330
Nothing could go better with it than this.

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:20.170
If this was gizzard, it wouldn't work at all.

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:22.840
It would absolutely kill all the flavor of the meat.

00:06:24.010 --> 00:06:26.070
It is something that disrupts my harmony.

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:29.810
My harmony, my order...

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:39.160
Even so, someone is trying
to destroy that harmony.

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:48.730
<i>Burn! I summon you, Phoenix!</i>

00:06:52.870 --> 00:06:55.310
He shot me! He shot me!

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:56.970
He shot me!

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:06.220
Oh, Your Excellency, you're so cute.

00:07:06.720 --> 00:07:10.750
With your permission, Your Excellency,
I'll deal with him at once!

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:13.620
Kill him!

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:17.100
Gladly!

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:24.860
Or rather, you're quite a coward for not
having smashed him then and there, Fungus!

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:28.070
What did you call me, Herba?!

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:34.740
I came back immediately to report the
news quickly to His Excellency!

00:07:36.980 --> 00:07:41.650
You're just disgusting, puffing that
stinking mold everywhere!

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:45.460
In my world, this harmonious Wonderland,

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:49.120
I cannot just allow people to do as they please.

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:52.590
Am I wrong, Oscha?

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:57.430
Of course not, Your Excellency. Rest easy.

00:07:58.270 --> 00:08:00.760
Oh, Oscha, you're back.

00:08:01.940 --> 00:08:06.440
My doll, Crux, is now on their trail.

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:11.010
No matter where they try to hide,
there is no way they can escape.

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:14.850
Oscha, you're really on the ball!

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:18.690
Don't waste your valuable words
praising me, Your Excellency.

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:20.660
Master Fungus,

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:27.160
I'm trusting you to take care of the
intruders from the Outside World.

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:29.740
That sounds good!

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:31.330
Go ahead and get it done, Fungus!

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:33.910
You can count on me, Your Excellency!

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:56.220
White Cloud... I won't forget.

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:11.810
Where are you?

00:09:14.350 --> 00:09:16.150
Sis!

00:09:17.180 --> 00:09:19.740
My legs hurt. Let's rest a little.

00:09:19.850 --> 00:09:23.020
We just took a break. Let's hurry up.

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:25.460
We've got to get to a place
that might have people.

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:32.620
That monster from before might
come back at any minute.

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:40.300
Ai, you came here to search
for your parents, didn't you?

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:44.670
But I had no idea Wonderland
would be this dangerous.

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:46.970
You read "Day of Conjunction," didn't you?

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:49.350
Day of Conjunction

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:49.350
World Wide Best Seller!

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:52.880
Your parents came here once
and made it back, didn't they?

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:52.600
Day of Conjunction

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:55.420
Yeah, but...

00:09:56.890 --> 00:09:59.760
Okay then, let's give it our best
and keep walking!

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:03.030
What about you, Lisa?

00:10:03.030 --> 00:10:05.120
Are you going to give it your best
and search for your boyfriend?

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:06.930
What?! Boyfriend?!

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:11.340
I'm going to give it my best!

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:15.010
Mom and Dad...

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:19.070
That day they just said they were
going to go look at Wonderland.

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:23.610
I thought they were just going down
by the cape again,

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:27.310
because they would always go there,
to take walks by the beach.

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:31.750
Hey, Lisa!

00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:34.760
Why don't you tell us something
about yourself?

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:37.560
All we've been doing is talking about us.

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:39.760
Yeah, I want to know too.

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:41.130
About me?

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:44.470
There it is again! Don't try and
trick us with that laugh!

00:10:44.570 --> 00:10:47.370
Hey, where did you learn that cool trick?

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:49.270
Is that like Kenpo?

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:51.610
I don't know about that.

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:55.040
What is it?

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:57.250
It sounds like something is squawking.

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:00.150
There it is.

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:03.110
Mr. Birdy?

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:06.160
A collar!

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:08.090
Is that the same bird from before?

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:12.160
What's up with him?

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:16.530
Don't stare at me.

00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:21.440
Sis, I think he likes you.

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:22.510
I think so too.

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:25.910
Did you forget what he did to me last time?

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:46.730
Hey, wait up!

00:11:49.740 --> 00:11:51.200
Mr. Birdy!

00:11:53.610 --> 00:11:56.700
What? Where in the world did he go?

00:11:58.050 --> 00:12:00.640
Hey, why are you chasing him anyway?!

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:04.010
He was wearing a collar. Maybe that
means he belongs to someone.

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:07.320
Even so, this place is...

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:10.320
Wow, what a weird forest.

00:12:10.890 --> 00:12:12.650
Is this even a real forest?

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:21.730
That's a person, isn't it?

00:12:22.370 --> 00:12:23.860
A friend of Mr. Birdy's?

00:12:24.270 --> 00:12:25.600
Excuse me...

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:32.440
I LOVE Chocobos!

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:35.250
What did she say?

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:39.510
Some call me Chocobaba!

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:41.050
Chocobaba?

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:46.620
At least, that's the rumor.

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:48.660
Rumor?

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:59.200
Did you guys come from the Outside World?

00:12:59.870 --> 00:13:01.970
What is the Outside World?

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:05.170
This is Wonderland, out there
is the Outside World!

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:07.170
Or at least that's the rumor.

00:13:07.780 --> 00:13:09.180
Another rumor?

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:11.550
Ms. Chocobaba, are you from this world?

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:16.790
I have no clue.

00:13:17.990 --> 00:13:20.830
Does this Mr. Birdy belong to you?

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:25.030
He is not Mr. Birdy, he's a chocobo.

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:26.260
According to another rumor?

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:29.000
Ms. Chocobaba...

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:33.800
I don't suppose you've seen my
parents around here, have you?

00:13:36.010 --> 00:13:37.710
I have no clue.

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:42.710
Do you know where we can find
a more populated area here?

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:46.410
And don't say "rumor" or "no clue"!

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:52.580
Oh no, this is bad news!

00:13:53.590 --> 00:13:56.290
What in the world is wrong with that old lady?

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:59.590
What is this?

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:02.990
It looks like a chocobo feather.

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:08.240
Not another bomb!

00:14:11.010 --> 00:14:13.340
Ai, Yu, go ahead and start running!

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:15.920
Let's go, Yu!

00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:17.380
Multiply, multiply, multiply, multiply...

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:19.580
Multiply, multiply, multiply, multiply...

00:14:19.690 --> 00:14:21.480
Multiply, multiply, multiply...

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:26.260
Ai! Yu!

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:38.300
Lisa!

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:40.800
Ai! Yu!

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:53.550
Chocobo!

00:14:53.650 --> 00:14:55.590
Did you save us?

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.060
He just ran away.

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:06.560
Ai! Yu!

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:19.640
Hey!

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:27.150
Kaze!

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:31.420
I have something I want to ask you.

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:34.320
Okay, but...

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:37.190
They're back!

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:59.190
So you've made your appearance,

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:01.950
Man of the Black Wind.

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:15.800
He's not human.

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:24.910
I am Fungus, one of the Four Lords of Gaudium!

00:16:25.350 --> 00:16:27.410
In the name of His Excellency, Tyrant,

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:30.040
I will kill you!

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:38.350
It has moved.

00:16:38.460 --> 00:16:39.690
Get back!

00:16:40.490 --> 00:16:43.290
Soil is my power!

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:18.230
The Magun has thawed!

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:24.330
A nice display.

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:28.170
If you really think you can
take me with the Magun,

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:31.010
go ahead and try shooting me.

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:34.750
The appropriate Soil to use against
you has been decided!

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:41.720
An infinity that surpasses the heavens, Sky Blue!

00:17:48.100 --> 00:17:52.330
A completeness that goes through
solid earth, Ground Brown!

00:17:56.100 --> 00:18:01.370
And finally, the deception to hollow
out a dimension, Magic Violet!

00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:21.380
Come! I summon you, Typhon!

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:41.450
Is that all you got? I can take this all day!

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:47.850
You're not going to do anything with that!

00:18:52.260 --> 00:18:53.160
What?

00:19:06.010 --> 00:19:08.800
What the heck?

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:14.440
What did you do?!

00:19:15.780 --> 00:19:17.720
Typhon is one with the wind.

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:21.820
He is a Summon that causes
space to disappear.

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:25.490
Hey, wait! Wait, don't do this!

00:19:26.030 --> 00:19:28.790
You can't do this!

00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:47.170
Did you ask if we knew White Cloud?

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:52.280
I'm sorry, we just don't know
much about this world.

00:19:52.390 --> 00:19:53.980
Sorry, but...

00:19:55.320 --> 00:19:57.980
So if you really are looking
for someone, we should...

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:03.720
Thanks for helping us.

00:20:06.870 --> 00:20:07.890
Thanks!

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:09.970
Thank you!

00:20:14.140 --> 00:20:15.470
Sis! Sis!

00:20:17.810 --> 00:20:19.070
Does it look good?

00:20:19.180 --> 00:20:20.410
Not at all.

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:23.010
Chocobo?

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:26.580
It looks like he's trying to tell us something.

00:20:26.690 --> 00:20:29.350
Oh no, he says the Subway is going to leave.

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:30.790
We've got to hurry up and get on!

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:35.130
Wait, Yu, how can you know he's saying that?!

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:55.780
I am so thirsty

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:55.780
Nodo ga karakara desu

00:20:55.780 --> 00:20:57.150
It's really getting bad

00:20:55.780 --> 00:20:57.150
Taihen nan desu

00:20:57.150 --> 00:20:59.280
It's burning up inside of me

00:20:57.150 --> 00:20:59.280
Kono mune ookaji desu

00:20:59.890 --> 00:21:02.620
My heart skipped a beat

00:20:59.890 --> 00:21:02.620
Kimi wo hitome mita

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:05.530
When I laid eyes on you

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:05.530
Shunkan bibi tto kita

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:07.190
It's just like torture

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:07.190
Goumon no you desu

00:21:07.190 --> 00:21:08.630
I can't take it

00:21:07.190 --> 00:21:08.630
Taekirenai desu

00:21:08.630 --> 00:21:10.650
Ever since I fell in love with you

00:21:08.630 --> 00:21:10.650
Kimi ni koi shite kara

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:14.100
My heart skips a beat whenever

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:14.100
Itsumo kimi to nita

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:16.630
I see a girl with hair like yours

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:16.630
Kamigata ni ha to suru

00:21:17.070 --> 00:21:20.710
Please, God

00:21:17.070 --> 00:21:20.710
Douka kamisama

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:25.010
Can you please give me wings?

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:25.010
Kono boku ni tsubasa kudasai yo

00:21:25.010 --> 00:21:28.550
From now on, my thoughts of you

00:21:25.010 --> 00:21:28.550
Kore kare kimi dake wo motto tsuyoku

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:31.180
Will only shine and grow stronger

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:31.180
Omotchatte kirakira

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:34.190
There's so much I want to tell you

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:34.190
Tsutaetai koto ippai

00:21:34.190 --> 00:21:37.190
There's not enough time left in the world

00:21:34.190 --> 00:21:37.190
Jikan ga tarinai nai ai ai

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:40.030
You are now the only person

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:40.030
Boku no hitomi ni wa mou

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:42.360
That my eyes can see

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:42.360
Kimi shika utsuranai

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:45.070
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:45.070
Kitai wa kore kara

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:48.270
All of these thoughts are too much for me

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:48.270
Nani kara nani made omoikitchatte

00:21:48.270 --> 00:21:51.200
So I'm just going to spill my guts

00:21:48.270 --> 00:21:51.200
Sa subete wo butsukeyou

00:21:51.310 --> 00:21:57.180
Nobody knows the right answer

00:21:51.310 --> 00:21:57.180
Seikai wa dare ni mo wakanai ai ai ai ai

00:21:57.180 --> 00:21:59.980
I'm already celebrating my joy

00:21:57.180 --> 00:21:59.980
Atama no naka de wa mou

00:21:59.980 --> 00:22:02.350
On the inside

00:21:59.980 --> 00:22:02.350
Shukufuku no kurakkaa

00:22:02.350 --> 00:22:05.320
Something is going to start

00:22:02.350 --> 00:22:05.320
Nani ka ga hajimaru

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:08.060
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:08.060
Kitai wa kore kara

00:22:08.060 --> 00:22:12.160
Let's never lose sight of our dreams

00:22:08.060 --> 00:22:12.160
Nozomi wo mochimashou

00:22:12.160 --> 00:22:13.520
All right!

00:22:12.160 --> 00:22:13.520
All right!

00:22:16.800 --> 00:22:19.360
Final Fantasy: Unlimited

00:22:23.700 --> 00:22:25.170
Here is my prophecy.

00:22:26.170 --> 00:22:28.440
This is the place where you and I shall meet.

00:22:28.910 --> 00:22:32.470
It is a dangerous place, where
pollen falls and flutters about.

00:22:32.580 --> 00:22:37.050
If you wish for it, it will come true.
Your dreams can become reality.

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:44.020
Next time, I will return to offer you
my Unlimited guidance.
